# The .ics files the outgoing www/demo/ serves are CRLF by specification
# (RFC 5545), and git on Windows would otherwise normalise them to LF on the
# way in. Goes when that directory does. calendar/data/series.ics is
# deliberately not here: it is a source file the generator parses, not one
# that is served, and the generated .ics files never touch git at all.
www/demo/downloads/*.ics -text
